# Missions: Brayden's Lombard Challenge won. The rider-line autopilot (lombard_crooked_line) rides the
# crooked block from Hyde round all eight hairpins faster than his e-scooter, and his talk step starts.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 mission start lombard 1
spawn lombard_crooked
bot line lombard_crooked_line 6
run 4200
expect event missionStep{mission=lombard,step=1,kind=race} within 1..1
expect event missionStep{mission=lombard,step=2,kind=talk} within 3900..4050
expect no event missionFailed
expect no event bail
